  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Gandiol Market Gardening Project</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The project funds will be used to provide mill shelters and mills for cereal processing; small equipment; an inputs fund for onion production and a fund to purchase paddy rice to process and sell. Additionally; training in financial and organizational management will be provided to help the group increase its management and operational capacity and become sustainable.</narrative>
  </description>
